275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (While it is easy for us to frame the data breaches and cybersecurity incidents that occur throughout the year by the organizations they impact, there has been a greater focus by news outlets to identify threats on their own. We can say with certainty which organizations experienced a cyberattack in 2023: Fidelity, T-Mobile \(thrice\), 23andMe, MGM Resorts in Las Vegas, and countless others without the large name to make the news. )
/E (While it is easy for us to frame the data breaches and cybersecurity incidents that occur throughout the year by the organizations they impact, there has been a greater focus by news outlets to identify threats on their own. We can say with certainty which organizations experienced a cyberattack in 2023: Fidelity, T-Mobile \(thrice\), 23andMe, MGM Resorts in Las Vegas, and countless others without the large name to make the news. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11 12 13]
>>
endobj
